  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.12 Public lands",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.12 “Public lands” means land owned by:\n\n(a) The federal government;\n\n(b) The state government;\n\n(c) Cities;\n\n(d) Towns;\n\n(e) School districts; or\n\n(f) Other political subdivisions.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.13)",
